{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30635","headline":"将归蜀留献恩地仆射二首 一 · 姚鹄","name":"将归蜀留献恩地仆射二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自持衡镜采幽沈，此事常闻旷古今。\n危叶只将终委地，焦桐谁料却爲琴。\n蒿莱讵报生成德，犬马空怀感恋心。\n明日还家盈眼血，定应回首即沾襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30635.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30635","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}